  "body": "## What changed\n\nSinker rough and finish passes accept an orbit.\nThe size law counts electrode width plus twice the spark gap and orbit radius.\nThe tip stands undersize minus orbit radius above the finished floor.\nOverburns refuse by name.\nA finish vector pattern must reach all four walls, so its direction count must be a multiple of four.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe size law counted spark gap alone.\nThe interim command guard refused every rough or finish orbit to prevent an unsafe judgment.\n\n## Tests\n\nThe app pins failed on unchanged production code before the fix.\n\n- `orbited_rough_finish_pair_reaches_size_in_sim` checks circular, four-direction vector, and planetary passes. Each finish has a clean verdict, zero gouge, and rest within simulation resolution.\n- `orbit_that_would_overburn_the_cavity_is_refused_by_name` checks rough and finish refusals.\n- `finish_orbit_without_full_axis_reach_is_refused_by_name` checks incomplete vector patterns.\n- `sinker_undersize_counts_orbit_width_and_keeps_the_floor` checks the shared size and floor law.\n- `sinker_undersize_checks_orbit_before_judging_it` checks malformed orbit inputs.\n\nCopying all three production files from upstream/main made the app pins fail again.\nRestoring the fix made them pass.\nFour individual mutations also failed their pins and passed after restoration: omit radius from width, restore the old floor stand, disable partial-vector refusal, and omit orbit validation.\n\nThe full app undersize suite passed 10 tests.\nThe motion undersize unit tests passed 3 tests.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed all three stages.\nThe gate passed 362 motion tests, 313 app unit tests, 31 sinker integration tests, and the UI sinker setup test.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\nThe earlier gate was canceled for a test-helper path adjustment and became VOID.\nThe final gate completed without source changes.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` was empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo real EDM control was exercised.\nThe fixtures use synthetic machine conditions and a rectangular cavity.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone of the changed files appeared in an open PR during the overlap checks.\nThis worker branched directly from upstream/main at 085a4717 as requested.\n\nEffort: high\n\nChangelog: Sinker rough and finish burns count orbit radius in wall sizing and floor stand-off, with named overburn and incomplete-vector refusals.\n\nFixes #1355\n",
